    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57308" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιβδηλ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>adulterate</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ</span>, 
